      "content": "aloe vera on my eyes?? i've never heard of that lol. but i'm kinda worried about the lightheadedness getting worse while i'm driving home later. is it safe to just take some ibuprofen to help with the head ache and get through the day? or should i be doing something else more intense to fix the dizziness fast?",
